      <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-gray-200">



        MindSpace Chat is a student-led emotional wellness platform created especially for teenagers. 



        We understand that students often deal with stress, peer pressure, loneliness, and overthinking. 



        Our mission is to create a safe, supportive, and judgement-free digital space where teens can 



        openly express themselves, connect with others, and feel emotionally supported through positive conversations.



